1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,688
The archive was never just one hall.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,235
Chapter Two is now a whole building.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:16,739
Three floors. Seven rooms. Ten new puzzles.

4
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,215
Find the hidden door. Walk through.

5
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:28,171
Warm pipes. Silent valves. Where does the pressure go?

6
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,988
Something knocks, from the room beyond.

7
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:40,581
A night cell. A light table. Sheets of coloured film.

8
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,745
A frozen door. Behind it, shelves that move.

9
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,660
Wipe the frost. Something stands behind the glass.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,026
A book lift to balance.

11
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:15,965
Above, a reading gallery. A board of names. A darkroom to focus.

12
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:29,290
The Director's office keeps one last lock.

13
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:35,076
No chase. No hurry. Just you, and the building.

14
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:38,803
Mystery Room. Lost Institute.

